On this day the Chaos Rift opened, and one of the Dark Gods of Alandria emerged, to test the resolve of the mortals!

This is no small feat, so gather your guardians, gather your guild mates and show your worth to one of the primal entities by defeating its avatar!

Chaos Rift major update, which unlocks at character level 100, includes:
[list]
[*] Serverwide competition to defeat the emerged Dark Gods with nifty rewards upon completion;
[*] Monthly personal and guild leaderboards, showing up the players and the guilds who managed to do most damage to the Dark Gods;
[*] New fighting attributes for the guardians, to combat the Dark Gods;
[*] New Redemption attribute, reflecting the progression of guardians evolutions;
[*] Forbidden Knowledge researches, allowing you to upgrade your heroes and guardians, and who knows what other potential rewards lurk in their depths.
[/list]
Good luck, brave adventurers!

